# <footer (optional): ref-keyword followed by issue number>
# <Closes, | Fixes | Refs> #<ID>
# e.g. "Closes #12"; "BREAKING CHANGE: <description>"

# Prefixes:
#   feat      adds a functionality
#   fix       corrects a defect
#   refactor  restructures code without affecting behaviour
#   perf      improves performance without affecting behaviour
#   test      adds or corrects tests
#   docs      changes the documentation only
#   style     changes the formatting without affecting behaviour
#   build     changes the build system, the packaging or the dependencies
#   config    changes the configuration of a tool, of the automation or of the repository
#   chore     maintains the repository without touching code, tests or documentation
#   revert    undoes an earlier commit
#   merge     merges two branches
# Comments: lines starting with '#' are ignored by git.
